        <p>• Statistics Jersey, ESSH ASW quarterly series · FOI 772310468 · Statistics Jersey Census 2011 &amp; 2021</p>
        <p>• States of Guernsey <em>Quarterly Population, Employment and Earnings Bulletin</em> · <em>Mortality Trends 2021</em> and <em>2024</em></p>
      </div>
    </div>
