<div class="support-footer">
  <strong>Support is available.</strong> If this content has raised difficult feelings, please reach out. Samaritans: <strong>116 123</strong> (free, 24/7) · <a href="https://www.samaritans.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">samaritans.org</a> · email <a href="mailto:jo@samaritans.org">jo@samaritans.org</a>. Isle of Man Lifeline: <strong>0808 808 8000</strong>. These statistics are published to support public health understanding, not to sensationalise. Recovery from suicidal crisis is possible — <a href="https://www.samaritans.org/support-us/our-research/research-archive/suicidal-behaviour-public-health-issue/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">evidence shows that most people who experience suicidal thoughts go on to live full lives</a>.
</div>

